  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 200°C/180°C fan-forced. Cut mini flour tortillas into quarters.\n• Drain sweetcorn. Grate carrot. Roughly chop cucumber.\n• Roughly chop plant-based slow braised meat.\n• Finely chop garlic.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/634909879e2b532bf9067d27/step-0fe9a9e8.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat a large frying pan over a high heat. Add the sweetcorn and cook until lightly browned, 4-5 minutes. TIP: Cover the pan with a lid if the kernels are jumping out. Set aside in a medium bowl.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/634909879e2b532bf9067d27/step-bd594911.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place the tortilla chips in a single layer on a lined oven tray. Drizzle (or spray) with olive oil, season with a pinch of salt and pepper and toss to coat. Bake until golden, 8-10 minutes. TIP: If the tortilla chips don't fit in one layer, spread them over two oven trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/634909879e2b532bf9067d27/step-1abc8c36.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the tortilla chips are baking, return frying pan to a medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Add plant-based slow braised meat, carrot and cook, tossing until browned, 3-4 minutes.\n• Add Tex-Mex spice blend, tomato paste and garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Add the plant-based butter and the water to the mixture, stirring to combine.\n• Reduce heat to medium, and sprinkle over plant-based shredded cheddar cheese and cover with a lid or foil, simmer until melted, 3-5 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/634909879e2b532bf9067d27/step-e579a9ee.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "To the bowl with the corn, add cucumber, a drizzle of white wine vinegar and a drizzle of olive oil and toss to combine. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/634909879e2b532bf9067d27/step-0fa441d8.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide the tortilla chips between plates.\n• Top with the plant-based slow braised meat mixture, corn salsa and a dollop of plant-based smokey aioli to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/634909879e2b532bf9067d27/step-93bc260e.jpg"
    }
  ]
